## The efficient way

And here's the idiomatic and more efficient way to do it:

::: {#fc9e5ce3 .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .with_columns(pl.sum_horizontal('Open', 'High', 'Low', 'Close')
               .alias('Sum_OHLC'))
 )
```

