## The showing off way

Or if you want to impress the hiring manager in a coding interview, you can do it like this.

::: {#31b5b50b .cell execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .with_columns(pl.sum_horizontal(pl.nth(list(range(1,5))))
               .alias('Sum_OHLC'))
 )
```

